Package: nativepair
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: morozhenko-apps
Depends: bluez, bluez-obexd
Homepage: https://github.com/morozhenko-apps/NativePair
Description: Native Android and iPhone integration for Linux
 NativePair integrates Linux with capabilities exposed by Android and iPhone
 through standard operating-system Bluetooth services. The baseline design
 requires no companion application on the phone.
